<title>FRANCE: ALPINE SKIING-LEADING PRACTICE TIMES IN MEN'S DOWNHILL.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-LEADING PRACTICE TIMES IN MEN'S DOWNHILL.</headline>
<dateline>VAL D'ISERE, France 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading practice</p>
<p>times on Thursday for a men's World Cup downhill race scheduled</p>
<p>on Saturday:</p>
<p> 1. Patrick Ortlieb (Austria)  One minute 52.52 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Josef Strobl (Austria)     1:52.66</p>
<p> 3. Werner Franz (Austria)     1:52.74</p>
<p> 4. Fritz Strobl (Austria)     1:52.89</p>
<p> 5. Guenther Mader (Austria)   1:53.60</p>
<p> 6. Roland Assinger (Austria)  1:53.80</p>
<p> 7. Luc Alphand (France)	 1:54.23</p>
<p> 8. Hannes Trinkl (Austria)    1:54.27</p>
<p> 9. Kristian Ghedina (Italy)   1:54.48</p>
<p> 10. Hans Knaus (Austria)	1:54.52</p>
</text>
